  sources:
  - name: DATA COLLECTION_Longmont_2024_GHG_Inventory
    authority: City of Longmont
    url:
    description: "A later version of the 2024 inventory (last saved 2025-07-27). It
      has three sheets that the March 2025 SharePoint original lacks. 'On-Road Data_NEW'
      is Francie's and authoritative: it is the origin of the 2024 VMT (Google EIE
      trip distances) and the 2024 transport factors. 'datasets' is Kausal's (Jouni
      Tuomisto): values copied by hand from the other sheets, not referenced, so it
      is never an origin. 'Sheet1' is hidden; it holds VMT working (HPMS breakdown,
      registered vehicles by type and fuel, vehicle MPG with sources), not primary
      data. Migrated from kausal-paths/data/longmont on 2026-11-13.; Attachment: client/DATA
      COLLECTION_Longmont_2024_GHG_Inventory.xlsx; Format: .xlsx; Date Last Updated:
      2025-07-27"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Longmont 2021 GHG Inventory (30 Jan 2023)
    authority: City of Longmont (inventory workbook created by Julia Ferguson)
    url:
    description: 'The 2021 community inventory, with years back to 2016 on the Year
      over Year sheet. Origin of the historical sector emissions (Year over Year),
      the GWPs, the waste emission factors, the transit share and the 2021-era fuel
      and vehicle factors. Sent by Francie Jaffe (City of Longmont); the date is when
      the file was last saved, which approximates when Kausal received it. A second
      copy with the same name but different bytes is at the top of the Drive folder
      (saved 2023-02-10). Years covered: 2016-2021.; Attachment: client/Longmont (CO)
      Client/KP material/FINAL_Longmont_2021_GHG_Inventory_01302023.xlsx; Format:
      .xlsx; Geographic Coverage: City of Longmont, Colorado; Date Last Updated: 2023-03-16;
      Updated by: Jouni Tuomisto (register row drafted by Claude, 2026-11-21)'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  dataset:
    time_resolution: yearly
    is_editable: true
  index_columns:
  - vehicle_type
  - energy_carrier
  - Year
  updated_at: '1795523471'
  units:
    Value: scf/a
